---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
	<main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-20">
		<header class="mb-20">
			<h1 class="text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-6">Take Real Custody of Your Bitcoin.</h1>
			<p class="text-2xl text-slate-600 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
				If your Bitcoin sits on an exchange, you don't own it — you own an IOU.
				I guide you through self-custody setup, step by step, on a live call.
				You execute. I verify every step.
			</p>
		</header>

		<section class="mb-20">
			<h2 class="text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-500 font-bold mb-8">Consultancy Philosophy</h2>
			<div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 text-slate-700">
				<p>Your Bitcoin is only as secure as the architecture protecting it. I bridge the gap between complex engineering and accessible, resilient custody solutions.</p>
				<p>With a background in software engineering and OTC trading, I bring a unique perspective on threat modeling, asset lifecycle management, and operational security.</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="mb-20">
			<h2 class="text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-500 font-bold mb-8">The Offer</h2>
			<div class="p-8 border-2 border-slate-900 rounded-2xl">
				<div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-6 flex-wrap gap-4">
					<div>
						<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-1">First Self-Custody Session</h3>
						<p class="text-sm text-slate-500">60 minutes · Remote (Telegram or Zoom) · Recorded</p>
					</div>
					<div class="text-right">
						<span class="text-3xl font-extrabold">€99</span>
						<p class="text-xs text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Intro pricing</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<ul class="space-y-3 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed mb-8">
					<li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-amber-500 font-bold">→</span> Threat model assessment — what are you protecting, from whom, how much</li>
					<li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-amber-500 font-bold">→</span> Hardware wallet recommendation for your specific situation</li>
					<li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-amber-500 font-bold">→</span> Live walkthrough: wallet creation, seed phrase generation, first receive + send test</li>
					<li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-amber-500 font-bold">→</span> Basic OPSEC: where to store your seed, what NOT to do, common mistakes</li>
					<li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-amber-500 font-bold">→</span> Written summary + recording sent after the session</li>
				</ul>
				<div class="border-t border-slate-200 pt-6 mb-6">
					<p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-4">
						Not sure if this is right for you? Start with a <strong class="text-slate-700">free 15-minute intro call</strong>.
						We assess your situation, you decide if you want to proceed.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
					<a href="https://cal.com/banitama/15min" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 bg-slate-900 text-white font-semibold rounded-xl hover:bg-slate-800 transition-colors">
						Book Free Intro Call
					</a>
					<a href="https://t.me/banitamas" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 border border-slate-300 font-semibold rounded-xl hover:border-slate-500 transition-colors">
						Ask on Telegram
					</a>
					<a href="https://wa.me/46760784309" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 border border-slate-300 font-semibold rounded-xl hover:border-slate-500 transition-colors">
						Ask on WhatsApp
					</a>
				</div>
			</div>
			<p class="mt-6 text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
				I guide, you execute. I never touch your keys, seed phrases, or coins. All sessions are recorded — you get the only copy. I am not a financial advisor. No investment advice. Custody setup and education only.
			</p>
		</section>

		<!-- Latest Insights (trimmed to 5 most recent) -->
		<section class="mb-20">
			<h2 class="text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-500 font-bold mb-8">Latest Insights</h2>
			<div class="space-y-6">
				<div class="p-8 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl hover:border-slate-400 transition-colors">
					<span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-500 mb-2 block">DIY Signing Devices</span>
					<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3">
						<a href="/insights/diy-signing-device-revolution-is-just-beginning" class="hover:underline">
							The DIY Signing Device Revolution is Just Beginning
						</a>
					</h3>
					<p class="text-slate-600 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
						The Specter DIY, SeedSigner, and Krux teams met for the first time in São Paulo,
						shared stewardship of the embit library, and launched deeper collaborations. The
						future of bitcoin self-custody via DIY signing devices is incredibly bright.
					</p>
					<a href="/insights/diy-signing-device-revolution-is-just-beginning" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 group">
						Read Article <span class="group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">&#8594;</span>
					</a>
				</div>
				<div class="p-8 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl hover:border-slate-400 transition-colors">
					<span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-500 mb-2 block">US Regulation</span>
					<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3">
						<a href="/insights/clarity-act-senate-delay-eu-bitcoin-holders" class="hover:underline">
							The CLARITY Act Punted to September. What It Means for EU Bitcoin
						</a>
					</h3>
					<p class="text-slate-600 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
						The US Senate went on summer recess without voting on the CLARITY Act, America's
						answer to MiCA. European bitcoin holders now have more regulatory clarity than the
						US exchanges they depend on. The delay matters more than you think.
					</p>
					<a href="/insights/clarity-act-senate-delay-eu-bitcoin-holders" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 group">
						Read Article <span class="group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">&#8594;</span>
					</a>
				</div>
				<div class="p-8 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl hover:border-slate-400 transition-colors">
					<span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-500 mb-2 block">Security Advisory</span>
					<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3">
						<a href="/insights/coldcard-mk3-seed-vulnerability-seedsigner-bitkey-alternatives" class="hover:underline">
							Coldcard Seed Vulnerability: $100 Million Gone, and Every Model Is Affected
						</a>
						</h3>
						<p class="text-slate-600 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
						What started as a Mk3 seed flaw has expanded to every device Coinkite ships. Over
						1,596 BTC stolen from 7,300 addresses. Firmware fixes are out for all models.
						Here is what every Coldcard owner must do now.
					</p>
					<a href="/insights/coldcard-mk3-seed-vulnerability-seedsigner-bitkey-alternatives" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 group">
						Read Article <span class="group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">&#8594;</span>
					</a>
				</div>
				<div class="p-8 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl hover:border-slate-400 transition-colors">
					<span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-500 mb-2 block">EU Regulation</span>
					<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3">
						<a href="/insights/mica-enforcement-begins-eu-crypto-blacklist" class="hover:underline">
							MiCA Enforcement Has Begun: Is Your Exchange on the EU Blacklist?
						</a>
					</h3>
					<p class="text-slate-600 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
						The deadline came and went. Now the enforcement starts. ESMA has named 164 crypto
						firms operating illegally in Europe. Binance is gone. MEXC is flagged. If your
						exchange is on that list, your money has zero legal protection.
					</p>
					<a href="/insights/mica-enforcement-begins-eu-crypto-blacklist" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 group">
						Read Article <span class="group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">&#8594;</span>
					</a>
				</div>
				<div class="p-8 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl hover:border-slate-400 transition-colors">
					<span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-500 mb-2 block">Bitcoin Protocol</span>
					<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3">
						<a href="/insights/bip-110-august-deadline-self-custody" class="hover:underline">
							The BIP-110 Deadline Is Here: What Self-Custody Holders Should Do Now
						</a>
					</h3>
					<p class="text-slate-600 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
						Block 961,632 is roughly two weeks away. Miners are signaling at under 1 percent.
						Lyn Alden says a chain split is possible. If you hold your own keys, here is what
						to check, what to avoid, and what to do before August 7.
					</p>
					<a href="/insights/bip-110-august-deadline-self-custody" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 group">
						Read Article <span class="group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">&#8594;</span>
					</a>
				</div>
				<div class="p-8 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl hover:border-slate-400 transition-colors">
					<span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-500 mb-2 block">Bitcoin Governance</span>
					<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3">
						<a href="/insights/bip-110-governance-showdown-self-custody" class="hover:underline">
							The BIP-110 Showdown: Who Gets to Decide What Bitcoin Is For?
						</a>
					</h3>
					<p class="text-slate-600 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
						On August 7, a minority of Bitcoin nodes will start rejecting blocks that miners produce.
						Not because the blocks are invalid. Because they do not signal support for a proposal under
						1% of miners want. If you hold your own keys, this governance fight is about who controls
						the rules your wallet lives under.
					</p>
					<a href="/insights/bip-110-governance-showdown-self-custody" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 group">
						Read Article <span class="group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">&#8594;</span>
					</a>
				</div>
				<div class="p-8 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl hover:border-slate-400 transition-colors">
					<span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-500 mb-2 block">EU Regulation</span>
					<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3">
						<a href="/insights/swedish-bitcoin-holders-caught-between-mica-and-skatteverket" class="hover:underline">
							Sweden's Bitcoin Holders Are Caught Between MiCA and Skatteverket
						</a>
					</h3>
					<p class="text-slate-600 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
						MiCA killed 92 percent of EU crypto firms. DAC8 now pipes every exchange transaction
						directly to the Swedish tax authority. Swedish bitcoin holders get the squeeze from
						both sides, and there is no holding period exemption to soften the blow.
					</p>
					<a href="/insights/swedish-bitcoin-holders-caught-between-mica-and-skatteverket" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 group">
						Read Article <span class="group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">&#8594;</span>
					</a>
				</div>
				<div class="p-8 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl hover:border-slate-400 transition-colors">
					<span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-500 mb-2 block">Bitcoin Security</span>
					<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3">
						<a href="/insights/bitcoin-quantum-recovery-tool-seed-phrase" class="hover:underline">
							Bitcoin's Quantum Recovery Tool: Why Your Seed Phrase Survives Q-Day
						</a>
					</h3>
					<p class="text-slate-600 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
						A quantum computer can break your private key, but it cannot reverse the hash that
						produced it. Project Eleven's Q-Day recovery proof shows how your seed phrase becomes
						a post-quantum proof of ownership, and what you can do today to reduce your exposure.
					</p>
					<a href="/insights/bitcoin-quantum-recovery-tool-seed-phrase" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 group">
						Read Article <span class="group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">&#8594;</span>
					</a>
				</div>
				</div>
					<p class="mt-8 text-sm text-slate-500">
						<a href="/insights/mica-phase-2-live-eu-bitcoin-aftermath" class="font-semibold text-slate-900 hover:underline">Browse all insights &#8594;</a>
					</p>
		</section>

		<section class="mb-20">
			<h2 class="text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-500 font-bold mb-8">Contact</h2>
			<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
				<a href="https://cal.com/banitama/15min" class="block p-8 border border-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors">
				<h3 class="font-bold mb-1">Book Consultation</h3>
						<p class="text-xs uppercase text-slate-500">Free 15-min intro call</p>
			</a>
			<a href="https://t.me/banitamas" class="block p-8 border border-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors">
				<h3 class="font-bold mb-1">Telegram</h3>
				<p class="text-xs uppercase text-slate-500">Encrypted Messaging</p>
			</a>
			<a href="https://wa.me/46760784309" class="block p-8 border border-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors">
				<h3 class="font-bold mb-1">WhatsApp</h3>
				<p class="text-xs uppercase text-slate-500">Direct Contact</p>
			</a>
			</div>
		</section>
	</main>
</Layout>
